{"id":4338,"date":"2025-01-31T06:37:51","date_gmt":"2025-01-30T21:07:51","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?post_type=platform-demo&#038;p=4338"},"modified":"2025-02-10T09:01:53","modified_gmt":"2025-02-09T23:31:53","slug":"creating-google-promotion-ids-in-feedops","status":"publish","type":"demo","link":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/demo\/creating-google-promotion-ids-in-feedops\/","title":{"rendered":"Creating Google Promotion IDs in FeedOps"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"4338\" class=\"elementor elementor-4338\" data-elementor-post-type=\"demo\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f2bfa58 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"f2bfa58\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dcfe4cb elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"dcfe4cb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Overview<\/span>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2243ee7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2243ee7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>This guide explains how Promotion IDs work within Google Merchant Center to track and manage specific promotions, such as free shipping or buy-one-get-one-free (BOGO) deals, directly linked to your ads. Learn when to use these identifiers to maximize ad performance and ensure promotions are applicable at checkout, complying fully with Google&#8217;s advertising policies. Discover how to create and manage Promotion IDs using FeedOps, simplifying the process of syncing promotions with your Merchant Center to improve conversion rates effectively.<\/p><h3><strong>Examples of Effective Promotions Using IDs:<\/strong><\/h3><ul><li><strong>Free Shipping:<\/strong> Connect free shipping offers on select products or orders above a certain value directly to your ads.<\/li><li><strong>BOGO Deals:<\/strong> Apply buy-one-get-one-free promotions to specific items or categories, ensuring conditions like minimum purchases are met.<\/li><\/ul><h3><strong>Setting Up Promotion IDs in FeedOps:<\/strong><\/h3><ol><li>Navigate to the product screen.<\/li><li>Filter by attributes such as brand or product category.<\/li><li>Add a Promotion ID column and input your ID (e.g., BOGO-2025) for targeted products.<\/li><li>Publish the rule to sync with Merchant Center.<\/li><\/ol><h3><strong>Using Feed Rules for Dynamic Promotions:<\/strong><\/h3><ul><li>Set up Promotion IDs with feed rules for items with high inventory turnover, such as &#8220;sports socks,&#8221; to ensure the promotion adjusts automatically with inventory changes.<\/li><\/ul><h3><strong>Finalizing Promotions in Google Merchant Center:<\/strong><\/h3><ul><li>Create your promotion using the established Promotion ID in FeedOps to ensure your shopping ads are accurately labeled, enhancing click-through and conversion rates.<\/li><li>Leverage this feature to ensure that your promotional offers are not only attractive but also perfectly aligned with the shopper&#8217;s expectations, driving more sales through your Google Shopping campaigns.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"featured_media":4306,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"template":"","class_list":["post-4338","demo","type-demo","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.6 (Yoast SEO v26.6) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Creating Google Promotion IDs in FeedOps<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Promotion IDs are unique identifiers within the GMC that link specific promotions. Creating Google Promotion IDs in FeedOps\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/demo\/creating-google-promotion-ids-in-feedops\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Creating Google Promotion IDs in FeedOps\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Promotion IDs are unique identifiers within the GMC that link specific promotions. Creating Google Promotion IDs in FeedOps\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/demo\/creating-google-promotion-ids-in-feedops\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"FeedOps\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/feedops\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-02-09T23:31:53+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/01\/Maximizing-Campaigns-with-Google-Promotion-IDs-YouTube-Thumbnail-1.png\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"4000\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"2250\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/png\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\/\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/demo\/creating-google-promotion-ids-in-feedops\/\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/demo\/creating-google-promotion-ids-in-feedops\/\",\"name\":\"Creating Google Promotion IDs in FeedOps\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#website\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/demo\/creating-google-promotion-ids-in-feedops\/#primaryimage\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https